---
import '../styles/tokens.css';
import '../styles/info.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght,700;1,800;1,900&family=Barlow:wght;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
    <title>Privacy Policy — tactik</title>
    <meta name="description" content="How tactik handles your data: no accounts, no tracking, peer-to-peer multiplayer." />
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='7' fill='%23171717'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='16' cy='16' r='6.5' fill='none' stroke='%2350e3c2' stroke-width='2.5'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="/og/og-privacy.jpg" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
</head>
<body class="info-page">
    <nav class="info-nav">
        <a class="info-brand" href="/">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="7" fill="#171717"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6.5" fill="none" stroke="#50e3c2" stroke-width="2.5"/></svg>
            tactik
        </a>
        <div class="info-links" id="info-menu">
            <a href="/tutorial">Tutorial</a>
            <a href="/about">About</a>
            <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
            <a href="/privacy" class="active">Privacy</a>
            <a href="/" class="play">▶ Play</a>
        </div>
        <div class="info-actions">
        <button type="button" class="info-theme" id="info-theme" aria-label="Toggle dark mode">
            <svg class="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2m0 16v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4m11.4 11.4 1.4 1.4M2 12h2m16 0h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"/></svg>
            <svg class="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="info-burger" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="info-menu">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="info-hero">
        <img class="hero-sticker" style="top: 18px; right: 5%; transform: rotate(-6deg);"
             src="/stickers/sticker-shield.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" />
        <span class="info-eyebrow">Privacy policy</span>
        <h1>Your data stays yours.</h1>
        <p class="lead">tactik is built to need as little of your information as possible. Here's exactly what happens, in plain language.</p>
    </header>

    <main class="info-wrap">
        <p class="policy-updated reveal">Last updated: 27 September 2026</p>

        <section class="policy-block reveal">
            <h3>1. No accounts, no tracking</h3>
            <p>There is no sign-up, no login, and no analytics beacon watching you play. We don't set tracking cookies, we don't fingerprint your device, and we don't sell anything — there is nothing to sell. The game runs entirely in your browser.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block reveal">
            <h3>2. How online multiplayer works</h3>
            <p>Online modes (PVP and Rondo) are peer-to-peer over WebRTC. That means:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Your game data goes directly to the other player(s)</strong>, not through our servers. Passes, positions, scores and emoji reactions travel browser-to-browser.</li>
                <li><strong>A matchmaking helper</strong> (PeerJS's public cloud service) briefly helps the browsers find each other, the same way a phone book helps you dial. It sees connection metadata (IP addresses, temporary peer IDs) needed to establish the call, under its own privacy policy.</li>
                <li><strong>Quick Match handles</strong> like "SwiftFox" are generated from the lobby seat — they're not tied to you and change between sessions.</li>
                <li><strong>Rondo room codes</strong> are random 4-letter codes that exist only while the room is open.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block reveal">
            <h3>3. What stays on your device</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Preferences</strong> such as mute settings and match options are stored in your browser's local storage, on your device only.</li>
                <li><strong>Nothing is uploaded.</strong> We have no database of players, no leaderboards stored server-side, and no way to identify you across visits.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block reveal">
            <h3>4. Contacting us</h3>
            <p>If you email us, we receive whatever you put in the email — your address and your message. We use it only to reply, and we don't add you to any list (there is no list).</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block reveal">
            <h3>5. Children</h3>
            <p>tactik is a simple football game suitable for all ages. Because there are no accounts, chats, or data collection, there is no personal information for a child to hand over in the first place. Multiplayer opponents see only a generated handle and gameplay data during the match.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block reveal">
            <h3>6. Changes to this policy</h3>
            <p>If this policy changes, the new version will be posted here with an updated date. The short version of our philosophy won't change: collect nothing, store nothing, share nothing.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block reveal">
            <h3>7. Questions</h3>
            <p>Anything unclear? <a href="/contact" style="font-weight:700;color:var(--c-link-deep)">Contact us</a> and we'll answer honestly.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="info-cta reveal">
            <h2>Play, privately.</h2>
            <p>No account. No tracking. Just football.</p>
            <a href="/">Play now</a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="info-footer">
        <nav>
            <a href="/tutorial">Tutorial</a>
            <a href="/about">About</a>
            <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
            <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        </nav>
        <span>© 2026 tactik. Made for football brains.</span>
    </footer>

    <script>
        const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
            entries.forEach(e => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('visible'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
        }, { threshold: 0.12 });
        document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(elm => io.observe(elm));
    </script>
<script>
(function(){
  // Theme: OS default, manual toggle wins, persists as tk-theme (shared with game)
  try {
    var saved = localStorage.getItem('tk-theme');
    if (saved === 'light' || saved === 'dark') document.documentElement.dataset.theme = saved;
  } catch (e) {}
  var themeBtn = document.getElementById('info-theme');
  if (themeBtn) themeBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
    var cur = document.documentElement.dataset.theme ||
      (window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light');
    var next = cur === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
    document.documentElement.dataset.theme = next;
    try { localStorage.setItem('tk-theme', next); } catch (e) {}
  });

  var btn=document.querySelector(".info-burger");
  var menu=document.getElementById("info-menu");
  if(!btn||!menu)return;
  btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
    var open=menu.classList.toggle("open");
    btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded",open?"true":"false");
  });
  menu.addEventListener("click",function(e){
    if(e.target.closest("a")){menu.classList.remove("open");btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");}
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
